---
description: Best practices for Next.js 15 applications using the App Router
globs: **/*.{ts,tsx}
---
- Utilize React Server Components (RSC) for server-side rendering where possible to improve performance.
- Minimize the use of 'use client' directives to reduce client-side JavaScript.
- Implement proper error boundaries to handle errors gracefully.
- Use Suspense for managing asynchronous operations and loading states.
- Optimize for Core Web Vitals to ensure a fast and smooth user experience.
- Leverage the new async runtime APIs (cookies, headers, draftMode) for server-side operations.